			{
				"slug": "about",
				"status": "published",
				"id": "pg-about-en",
				"locale": "en",
				"data": {
					"title": "About DAFU",
					"intro": "大福 means great fortune. We named our group after the wish you hear at every Hong Kong and Macau dinner table — and we cook to make it come true.",
					"content": [
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k1s",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k1t",
									"text": "Where we come from",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k1u",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k1v",
									"text": "Our founders grew up on the food of Hong Kong and Macau: steaming dai pai dong woks, early-morning congee shops, cha chaan teng milk tea, Portuguese egg tarts on Macau side streets, and late nights in Lan Kwai Fong.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k1w",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k1x",
									"text": "DAFU brings those places to Malaysia, starting at the top of Genting Highlands, where visitors from across Malaysia and the region come to eat, play and stay up late.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k1y",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k1z",
									"text": "What we care about",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k20",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k21",
									"text": "Each DAFU restaurant does one thing well, the way the original would. Wok heat at the seafood kitchen. Patience at the congee pot. Atmosphere at the bar. Recipes and techniques come from Hong Kong and Macau; the welcome is Malaysian.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k22",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k23",
									"text": "What’s next",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k24",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k25",
									"text": "DAFU Seafood, DAFU Congee and DAFU Sing Bar are the first three. More brands and outlets will follow in Genting Highlands and the Klang Valley.",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"slug": "about",
				"status": "published",
				"id": "pg-about-zh",
				"locale": "zh",
				"translationOf": "pg-about-en",
				"data": {
					"title": "关于大福",
					"intro": "“大福”是港澳饭桌上最常听到的祝福。我们以此命名，也用每一道菜去实现它。",
					"content": [
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k26",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k27",
									"text": "我们的由来",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k28",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k29",
									"text": "我们的创办人在港澳饮食中长大：大排档的猛火镬气、清晨的粥店、茶餐厅奶茶、澳门街头的葡挞，还有兰桂坊的不夜天。",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k2a",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k2b",
									"text": "大福把这些地方带到马来西亚，第一站就在云顶高原——来自全国与区域各地的旅客在这里吃喝玩乐、通宵达旦。",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k2c",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k2d",
									"text": "我们坚持的",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k2e",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k2f",
									"text": "每一家大福餐厅都专注做好一件事，就像原汁原味的港澳老店：海鲜厨房的镬气、粥锅前的耐心、酒吧里的气氛。食谱与技艺源自港澳，招待则是马来西亚式的热情。",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k2g",
							"style": "h2",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k2h",
									"text": "下一步",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"_key": "k2i",
							"style": "normal",
							"markDefs": [],
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"_key": "k2j",
									"text": "大福海鲜大排档、粥大福与兰桂坊是我们的首三个品牌。更多品牌与分店将陆续进驻云顶高原及巴生谷。",
									"marks": []
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			}
